## Justin SDK

This project is set up with [justin-sdk](https://github.com/justinhaaheim/justin-sdk),
a cross-project toolchain that keeps shared configuration, scripts, and agent
instructions consistent across Justin's projects (linting, formatting, TypeScript
config, beads issue tracking, environment checks, and more).

Quick commands:

- `bun run signal` — typecheck + lint + prettier check
- `bun run doctor` — environment/config health (scaffolding, not code)
- `bun run fix` — auto-fix code (lint --fix + prettier --write)
